ProjectALife.DialogueShards["barks_contact_1"] = {
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","",{"Trouble. Keep your eyes open","That doesn't look friendly","I don't like this at all","Be ready. This could get ugly","Don't give them an easy chance","We need to be careful here","Watch yourself. This isn't a welcome","I was hoping not to do this today","Don't turn your back on trouble","Stay awake. Something's wrong","Damn. We can't relax yet","Keep calm. Don't make this easier for them","Looks like trouble found us","Pay attention now. Please"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=law",{"Trouble! Stay ready, all of you!","Sheriff's office! Drop the weapon! Drop it!","Watch yourself. This doesn't look good","Shots fired! Get down!","Watch it! Something's wrong!","Somebody hostile! Don't get caught out!","Somebody out there. Could be trouble","Anybody able to help? We've got trouble here","Somebody out there. Steady now, don't start anything","Sheriff's office! Put your weapons- they're not listening","I don't like this. Stay ready for trouble","Trouble. Stay careful and let me think","Keep your eyes open. Something's wrong here","Don't assume they're friendly. Stay careful","Hold your fire, hold your fire, see what they do first","People we don't know. Be careful"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=swat",{"Somebody hostile. Stay careful!","Keep your eyes open! Don't get caught out!","Trouble! Don't let yourself get hurt!","Someone hostile. Keep watching","Police! Show me your hands!","Keep watching! Don't relax!","Hostiles. Don't get caught off guard","This looks bad. What do we do?","Trouble. Hold, hold. Let me think","Hostile intent, hostile intent, weapons up","Trouble out there. Be ready for anything","Trouble out there. Keep watching","I see hostiles. Waiting to see what happens","Hold, hold, I'm identifying them"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=military,elite",{"Someone hostile! Stay ready!","Be careful! We can't trust this!","Watch out! Stay together!","Trouble! Don't give them an easy chance!","This isn't friendly. Don't get caught out!","Trouble! Be careful out there!"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Oh God, this isn't good! Be careful!","Watch out! I don't like this!","Somebody's out there. Be ready for trouble","Is that-- oh, I don't trust this. Stay careful","Trouble! Look after yourselves!","Somebody's out there, and they don't look friendly"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Heads up, this one's packing!","He's strapped! Spread out!","Got somebody looking for trouble over here!","Iron! He's got iron!","Somebody wants trouble. Fine by me","Look at this cowboy, take him!"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Oh no, oh no, those are not the good kind of people, those are NOT the good kind","Oh, I don't like this! Be careful!","Is that- is that them? The ones from yesterday? It's them, it's THEM!","Don't let them see us, please, don't even breathe-","Somebody's coming. Oh God, what do they want?","Hide- hide- hide- where do we hide?!","They look mean, they look so mean, I don't want to be seen","Let them walk on by... please, just walk by-","Oh sweet Jesus, people. I don't trust this","That person-- oh, NO. I don't like this, BACK!","I don't like this- I DON'T LIKE THIS, go!","Shhh, shhh, somebody there. I don't think they're friendly","I can't tell what they're thinking. That's worse somehow","My stomach just dropped, look at them, just look at them","Down, get down, and don't look at them","Please, no, not people, I can handle the dead ones, but not people"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Somebody's out there. Don't trust them yet","Trouble out there. Stay where we can see each other","Those guys don't look friendly, let's go the other way","Keep your hands where they can see, in case they look this way","Don't wave, don't call, I don't trust them","Somebody out there, and I don't like this","I don't like the look of that bunch, not at all","Walk away, calmly, like we didn't see them","We should turn around. This looks like trouble","Don't make eye contact, just keep walking","Hey, what's going on? Somebody's out there","They don't look like they're here to help anyone","Stay back, let me see what they want, stay back"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Not friendly. Ease back quietly","People out there. Keep careful","That's a crew, and they're not here to share","Hold up, I don't like how they spread out","I don't trust this. Stay ready","Raiders, probably, don't give them a reason","Stay out of their line of sight, let's find another way","I don't know them. Ease back","They'll rob us at best, let's avoid it","Quiet, quiet. Don't let them catch you off guard","Strangers. Don't provoke them","Guys like that don't ask politely, let's slip away"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|mood=grim",{"Here we go again, people are always worse than the dead...","Course it's them, who else would it be?","The dead don't rob you, only the living bother with that"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|mood=angry",{"Damn bastards, if they come over here I'll put one in the first one","Those assholes again, I'm sick of this, SICK of it"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=calm",{"People out there. Nothing sudden. Let's walk away","Easy now. Keep your distance and don't rush them","Strangers. Keep still and see what they do"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=family_elder",{"Oh, Lord. People. What do we do?","I've seen that look, honey, that's trouble, come away","Don't provoke them, just back up slowly, slowly"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=family_youth",{"Oh crap, oh crap. This looks BAD","Is that them? Dad, is that them?","Don't see us, don't see us, don't see us, please"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=family_woman",{"Get the children down, now, please, quiet, quiet","Somebody out there. Try not to draw attention"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=family_man",{"Everyone behind me, keep quiet, I'll handle this","Stay put, I'll talk to them, no sudden moves"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Hostile. I don't think they want help","Hold position, I don't trust them, hold on"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=rescue_medical",{"Easy. I'm just trying to help people. Don't hurt us","We're here to help people. Don't hurt us"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=rescue_clergy",{"Lord, protect us, those men do not come in peace","Stay calm, stay quiet, they may pass us by"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=worker",{"Aw, hell, that's a crew, and they ain't selling anything","Stay careful. This could go badly","Don't say a word to those guys, not even hi"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=civilian_loner",{"Company. Don't like it. I'd go the other way","Trouble, I'd bet money, not worth it"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=civilian_woman",{"Somebody out there. They don't look kind","Please let us pass, please, we don't want anything"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=civilian_man",{"Careful now. Don't make a sudden move","Easy, stay quiet. I'd rather not draw attention"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=law|tmp=seasoned",{"Trouble. Give each other room and stay careful","Hostiles, count three, I'll try to talk first"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=law|mood=fear",{"Oh shit, oh shit. I don't think we should stay here","I'm not ready for this, I'm not, there's too many"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=military",{"This doesn't look friendly. Stay ready","Somebody we don't know. Be ready","Hostiles, sir, form up, form up","We have company. I don't think they're friendly","People out there. Keep watching them","Sir, they don't look like military, they look like raiders","Be careful. I see people, and I don't like this"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=soldier_green",{"Are they with us? Somebody tell me!","Oh God, sir, are they going to shoot us?","They aren't with us. Stay careful"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=soldier_nco",{"Hostiles. Stay ready and don't lose your head","There's trouble. Steady now","Be ready. I don't like the look of this"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=deserter",{"Hostiles, damn it, I'm not getting shot over this, back off","Keep down! Don't make yourself easy to spot!"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=militia",{"Trouble out there, boys. Keep careful","Those ain't friendly, I can tell by how they carry themselves","Spread out, spread out, if they start shooting we shoot back"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=elite",{"Hostiles. Be ready","I don't trust this. I'm watching","Careful now. Let's see what happens","People out there. Hold a moment"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=elite_delta",{"Trouble. I'm waiting","Four hostiles, watching"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hey, hey, we got company. Doesn't look friendly","Who the hell are those assholes?","Somebody's coming. Be ready for trouble!","Strangers! Be careful, be CAREFUL","There's four of 'em, maybe five, we can take 'em","Well, well, well, look who's walking into our territory","Hell, this looks like more trouble than we need","They don't look friendly. Keep your head on straight","Shit, shit, they're not the usual, they look organized","Back up, back up, I don't like how they're spreading out","Who's that? Is that law? That's law, isn't it, oh no","Tell me this isn't trouble. Please, tell me","Eyes up, fellas, and hands on your iron","Heh, somebody's getting robbed today, and it's not us"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=fresh",{"This looks bad, oh no, what do we DO?","I don't want to fight them, I don't want to, I really don't want to"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Mmm, new trouble. How exciting","Ooh, they brought toys, let's go take 'em","Heh heh heh, finally some entertainment"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=raider_boss",{"Hold your fire, wait for my word, let them come closer","Spread out, let them think they've got us, then we show 'em"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=gang_boss",{"Eyes on them, hands on your pieces, nobody moves till I say","Rival crew or just trash? We'll find out"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=biker",{"Hey, boys, got some visitors, let's go say hello... loudly","Those aren't ours, brothers. Be careful"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=prisoner",{"Oh no. They look like trouble, I KNOW it","Be careful! Don't give them an easy chance!"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=crime_member",{"Not ours. Uh-oh, boss, we have a problem","Wait, wait, don't shoot, let me see who they are first"}},
{"CONTACT_HOSTILE","role=outlaw",{"Well, I'll be, strangers with iron, now ain't that a thing","Keep watching them, boys. Let's see what they want"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","",{"One of the dead. Don't let it get hold of you","That's not somebody we can talk to","Oh, no. Another of those things","Look alive. The dead aren't staying dead","I see it. I wish I didn't","Keep away from that thing's mouth","Don't waste your breath calling to it","That one's gone. You can tell","Dead one. Be careful now","I hate seeing them like this","There's one. Let me think","Don't let it fool you. It isn't well","Oh, Christ. Not a living person","Watch that thing. Don't get careless","Infected - keep your distance","Watch that one, don't let it grab you","Dead one moving - eyes up","We've got company, not the talking kind","That's not a survivor - be ready","Keep your hands clear of its mouth","I see it - give me room","Stay loose, don't get cornered","Look alive, that thing isn't","One of the dead - mind your footing","There - see how it moves?","Quiet now, we can handle this","Infected in sight - watch your spacing","Keep a way out - always","Don't rush it, watch the hands","Something dead is still moving","Saw it - keep watching for another","No closer than you have to","Watch the teeth, that's all it takes","That one's gone - don't try talking","Infected - keep calm","Don't bunch up for it","Leave enough room to swing","Stay on your feet, keep looking","I don't like the look of that one","Another dead face, here we go","Check around us before we commit","Don't stare at just the one","You see it? Keep back","Easy, no need to panic","That's infected, no doubt about it","Keep those hands away from you","Put some space between you and that thing","Seen it - watch my blind side","Nobody gets bitten over this","Steady now - pick your moment","Dead one - don't lose your head","Stay ready, it can still hurt you","This one isn't getting a handshake","Don't turn your back on it","It's getting too close, MOVE!","We all know what that is... eyes up","Eyes on the infected, ears on everything else","Watch it until it stays down","Take your time, not your chances","That one's trouble - give it space","Careful, dead doesn't mean harmless","Hold your nerve, we've seen this before","Spotted an infected - check your footing","There it is, nobody do anything stupid"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Oh God, it's one of them, it's looking at me","Hold on, is that one of them? That's one of them","Don't move, there's one up ahead, don't move","Oh no, there's another one","Heads up, something's walking funny, that's one of them","Over there, by the- it's one of the sick ones!","One of them, just the one... we can handle one, right?","Uh- guys? Guys, there's a- there's one right there","Wait, look at the way it's walking, that's not right","I think that's one of them, I think I'm right, look at its arm","There's a man over there, and he isn't right, I don't like it","Stay behind me, there's one of those things ahead","Quiet, quiet, quiet, one of the dead ones is just standing there","God, he used to be somebody's husband, look at him","Oh no, a kid, it's a little kid, I can't, I can't do it","Is it- is it one of them? It doesn't look hurt, it just looks wrong","Infected ahead, at least one, maybe two","Look, look, keep quiet. I'd rather not draw it closer","Another dead one, same as yesterday, same as always...","Just the one, thank God, just the one","I hate the way they stand still like that, it's worse than when they walk","It's slow, it's slow, we can go around it, right?","Ugh, God, the smell, it's close, there's one close","Back up, easy, easy, it's not looking yet","Please be a person... hello? Please- aw, no","That's one of them, isn't it? Tell me I'm wrong","Careful, careful, there's one standing right there","Oh man, oh man, I think it's coming this way","My heart is going to come out of my chest, one's right there"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Dead one. Slowly, quietly, give it room","One ahead, walking slow","One ahead of us, dead ahead, nice and slow","There's a dead one ahead, let it come to us","Stay calm, it's just one, we've handled worse","One of them. Don't assume it'll be slow","Single infected, no friends that I can see","Quiet now. One out there, and I'd rather not draw attention","I count one, wait, no, there's another behind it","Infected. Keep an eye on it","Okay, one, and he's alone, let's not make this loud","Ugh, another one, they just wander into everything","Hold still, it'll lose interest if we're lucky","It's not fast, but it never quits either, so don't waste time","One coming, who's got a clean swing?","Got one up front, quiet now, back up slow","Damn, I thought we'd cleared this area already","Dead one, nobody panic, we know how this goes","Another one, look at the clothes on it, poor guy","Single infected, let's drop it without any noise","Right, there's one. Keep your mouths shut and give it room","He's got an arm hanging wrong, slow, he's an easy one","Don't shoot, wait, it's just one and I don't want to bring the neighborhood","Yeah I see him, give me a second to think","That's one of them all right. Don't go near it","One more of them, hell, there's always one more"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=law",{"Infected ahead, deal with it quietly","Got an infected, one, straight ahead","Dispatch, I've got a 10-96 walking right at me, over","Infected. Let's not make any noise yet","Hell, there goes another one","One of the dead. No point talking to it","I see one of the dead. Don't let it get close","One of them, hold your positions, I'll look at him","Sheriff's office, STOP- no, no, he won't stop, he never stops","That's Earl Tuttle's boy, goddamn it, he used to wave at my daughter","Easy, easy, I see him, let him come to us","One infected, deputies fall back and let him come","Another infected, ten-twenty is right here, keep your voices down","Watch that one, he's quick... no, slow, never mind","Don't fight them unless he closes, we don't need the noise","Damn it, I hate when they stand there swaying like that","I've got visual on one hostile, uh, infected, not human, you know what I mean","One coming from the east, someone call it in, over","That one's dead, no question, hold your fire until we need it","Dead one. Don't let it grab you","I see it, I see it, hold on, I need a clear shot","Unit to unit, I've got a dead one in front of me, repeating, a dead one"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=military,swat,elite",{"Infected, front! Weapons ready!"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Dead one, kill it or step around it, I don't care","Hey, hey, look at this fucker, there's one of them","Aw shit, one of them dead things, get back","Ah, shit. Leave me the fuck alone","Damn, another one, they're EVERYWHERE","Ha! One of them, boys, think he wants a hug?","Oh fuck, oh fuck, one's right there, don't move","There's one of them sick freaks, let it come, then smash it","Don't get close enough for it to grab you","Goddamn it, I hate these things, I HATE them","Here comes trouble, and it ain't even breathing","Look at it, mouth hanging open like it wants to say something","What the hell, how's that thing even still moving?","Somebody go kill that thing before it spots us","Yeah, there's one, so what, we've killed forty of 'em already","Whoa, whoa, whoa, one of 'em, shut up, shut UP, it's looking","I see it, I see it, I'm not scared, it's a dead man, that's all","Oh no you don't, you ugly son of a bitch, not today","Shit! One of 'em! Move! Move! Move!","Back up, back UP, don't let that thing touch you","Dead guy at eleven, he looks lonely, ha ha"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"OH- oh no, no no no, one of THEM!","There's- there's one, it's walking, it's WALKING right at us!","Oh God- that one's sick, it's SICK, look at its face!!","Is that- is that Mr Hadley? no, no it can't- it IS, oh Jesus-","W-wait, wait, wait, it's moving! It's MOVING!","Infected! INFECTED! Somebody- anybody- there's one right there!","Don't look at it, don't look, just- just back up slow...","Ohhh no, nooo, not again, please not again","Look at that thing! Oh shit, oh shit-","Why's it still walking, it's got half its-- no, don't look at it","One of the sick ones! Right there! Right THERE!!","I can't- I can't breathe, there's one coming, there's one-","Oh my God it's looking at us, it's looking, GO, go go go","Hey- hey, HEY, there's one over there! One of them!","No, no, not now, I just got my breath back, not NOW!","It's one of them, it's one of them, it's one of them-","Somebody tell me it's a drunk, please tell me it's just a drunk...","Ahh! Dead one! Dead one, right there!","Jesus Christ, they keep coming, they just keep COMING","Shhh... there's one, right there, I'm not even breathing","I see one! I see it! What do we do, what do we DO?!","Is that- Jesus, that was a person, wasn't it? Wasn't it?","My knees are gone, there's one coming and my knees are GONE","Infected! Watch it, WATCH IT!","Oh sweet Jesus, it's coming straight at me, why me?!"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|mood=grim",{"Another one, damn it, another one, when does it stop","Saw its face, wish I hadn't, they all look like somebody now","One more to put down, and one more after that, and one after that..."}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|mood=angry",{"Son of a bitch, there's another one, damn it all to hell","Oh for- again?! Really?! Again?!","Get the hell away from here, I'm not in the mood for you"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=calm",{"I see one. Let's go around, I don't want to get close","There's a dead one ahead, nothing to worry about yet","One zombie on the left... no, wrong word, one of them, on the left","Single one, slow, we have time","Eyes up, there's one coming, nice and slow","Looks like a lone one, we'll see about it","It's just wandering, we can wait it out"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=family_elder",{"Lord, there's one of them out there, bless his poor soul","That used to be a person, y'all, you remember that","Oh, my- one of the dead ones, honey, come away","I've seen that look on a face before, only it was a living face","Dear God, it's moving and it shouldn't be","Don't you let it get close, you hear me? Stay back","Oh no, no, Lord, don't make me watch another one","I'm too slow for those things, y'all go ahead and tell me where to stand"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=family_youth",{"Oh shit- oh my God, there's one, there's one!","Mom said don't look, but I looked, it's coming!!","Wait- no way, that's not... that's real, it's REAL","Dude, dude, DUDE, there's a dead guy walking! Right there!","Holy- holy crap, hey, hey guys, one of them!","I'm not scared, I'm not, I'm- ohhh God I'm so scared","Seriously?! Right now?! I'm barely holding it together!"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=rescue_clergy",{"Lord, spare us, there's one among us again","Forgive me, I can't look at it, I can't, it was a parishioner...","Oh, brother, I know you, don't let it be you...","Stay behind me, I've said this over a hundred burials and now this"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=rescue_firefighter",{"One of them on your left, watch the crowd behind it","Got one in view, I'll draw it off, everyone stay put","Okay, one coming, we've trained for this kind of thing, sort of","I don't like it, one's coming, keep the group tight"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=rescue_medical",{"One of the infected. Hard to believe that's a person","Okay, there's a patient down the way, and there's no helping that one","Don't touch it, don't let it near you, there's nothing I can do for it","That's no cardiac arrest, that's a different thing entirely"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=worker",{"Aw, hell, there's one of 'em right there","Damn, another one wandering in, I just got through with the last","Hold on, I know that guy, we worked the same shift, oh no","There's one, there's one, I'll handle it, y'all keep out of the way","One's out there, you want to wait or you want me to take it?","Hey, boss, eh, never mind, forget it, there's one of them ahead","Seen it, don't need to see it twice, one of them, let's go"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=civilian_loner",{"One ahead, quiet, I'll take care of it","Okay, I see him, he's far off, I can wait","Same as always, one ahead, lonely work, this","Dead one. I'm not in the mood for this","Can't even get a minute to myself"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=civilian_woman",{"Oh God, there's one right there, it's looking at us","There's one, honey, get behind me, c'mere","That's one of them, isn't it, don't tell me it isn't","One infected, and it's heading straight for us, we have to move","Don't scream, don't scream, don't scream, just go quiet"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=civilian_man",{"Got one, ahead, keep it down","That's a bad one, I can tell from here, let's circle round","Damn it, one of those dead bastards, slow it down, boys","Yep, there he is, there's one every time we turn around"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=law|tmp=seasoned",{"Another one, same as the last, just aim for the head","Got one, quiet, we do this by the numbers","One out front, spread out a little, don't clump up","Infected. I'll try to handle it if I have to"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=law|mood=fear",{"Jesus, Jesus Christ, it's still walking, I put two in him and it's still WALKING","I can't- I can't do this one, I know him, that's Danny from the bakery","Oh my God, it's looking at me, why is it looking at me"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=law|mood=angry",{"Back off, BACK OFF, one more step and- no, he's not listening, is he","Son of a BITCH, there's another one"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=swat",{"I see one of the dead. Stay back from it","One of the dead. Still getting used to saying that","Target ahead, dead, moving, hold fire","Mover at the end of the line, single","Infected spotted, one, awaiting call","Watch out, one body, slow","I see one of the dead. Stay careful","It's one of the dead. What do we do?","Visual on one, hold, hold, hold","Mover, left, one only, quiet engagement","Infected in the open, I have a shot","I've got one at three o'clock, closing slowly","One of them! Don't lose your head!"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=swat|mood=fear",{"Oh shit, oh shit, it's one of them, it's REALLY one of them"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","reg=military",{"One of the dead out there. Keep watching it","One of the infected. Should we leave it alone?","One hostile, bearing zero-two-zero, moving toward us","Sergeant, I've got an infected on the left","Visual, one dead, sir, shambling, closing","One of the dead. Wait a moment","Stay quiet, stay low, one's in the open, let it pass if it will","Hold fire! One infected, no more than that","One of the dead... no, no, I'm not saying that, one infected","Dead ones, front, hold the line","Infected sighted, small arms only, don't waste the heavy stuff","Target in sight, awaiting orders","He's just standing out there, sir, should we go around?","Quiet, everyone, I'm calling this one in","Got movement, dead movement, left flank, over"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=soldier_green",{"Sarge! Sarge! There's one, there's one right there!","Is- is that one of them? Is that REALLY one of them?","I'm not shooting that, I'm NOT, that's a person, that's somebody's dad","Oh God, oh God, sir, it's coming at us, what do I do?!","They didn't show us this in training, they didn't show us ANY of this...","Sir? Sir, he's not stopping, I told him to stop twice!","S-sir, I see something, it's, it's wrong, it's walking wrong","My hands are shaking, I can't hold it steady, sir, it's coming"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=soldier_nco",{"Infected, front, calm down, everybody calm down","Dead one. Steady now, don't make a fuss","All right, listen up, there's a dead one out front, watch me","I see it, trainee, breathe, aim, wait for it","Get your head in the game, it's one infected, not the whole county"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=deserter",{"Great, one of them, just great, this is exactly why I left","Ah hell, a dead one... freeze, it hasn't clocked us yet","I'm not going back there, I'm not, I'll go around the damn thing","Dead man walking, ha, ha, no it's not funny, sorry, I know it's not"}},
{"CONTACT_INFECTED","role=militia",{"Got a sick one, boys, spread out and watch the flanks","One of them out front, keep calm, you know your drill","That's Randy, y'all, that was Randy, Lord, look at him","Shh, shh, ease off. One of 'em coming, give it some room","Single infected, let him come, we'll finish it"}},
